.TH PLATEFOLD 1 "" "Plate|Fold" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
platefold \- render documents to print-quality PDFs with room for wide figures
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B platefold
[\fIoptions\fR] [\fIinput\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B platefold
turns Markdown, DOCX, XLSX, CSV and TSV documents, and DOC, ODT or RTF
through an installed converter, into PDFs. Each wide diagram or table is
placed on a page it fits: inline, on a landscape plate, or on a larger sheet
sized to it.
.PP
\fIinput\fR is one document or a folder of documents. PDFs are written to
\fB\-o\fR \fIfolder\fR, or to a folder named "PDF Export" beside the input
folder. For a single file, that is beside the folder holding it, one level up.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-o ", " \-\-output " " \fIfolder\fR
Write the PDFs to \fIfolder\fR.
.TP
.BR \-\-preset " " \fIpaper\fR
Paper size, such as letter, a4 or auto.
.TP
.BR \-\-theme " " \fIname\fR
A built-in or custom theme, or source to use a DOCX or XLSX document's own
palette.
.TP
.BR \-\-browser " " \fIchoice\fR
The rendering engine: auto (the default), bundled, system, edge, chrome,
chromium, brave, or an executable path. With auto, when the system refuses the bundled Chromium its
sandbox, an installed Chrome, Chromium, Edge or Brave is used instead. The
sandbox is never turned off.
.TP
.B \-\-json
Print the result as JSON.
.TP
.B \-\-list\-themes
List the built-in and installed themes and font sets.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print the version and exit.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show every option.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/platefold/themes
Your themes (default \fI~/.config/platefold/themes\fR).
.TP
.I $XDG_CACHE_HOME/platefold/diagram\-cache
Diagram cache (default \fI~/.cache/platefold/diagram\-cache\fR).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR platefold\-desktop (1)
.PP
https://maxfield-allison.github.io/platefold/
